{"id":"n66864-1-7","stage":3,"title":"앗 · 唷","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66864-1-7-1","ko":"너 오늘 약속 있다고 하지 않았어?","zh":"你不是说今天有约吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"약속","meaning":"约定，约好，承诺","explanation":"약속：约定，约好，承诺","readings":[{"term":"약속","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36695","senseId":"1","lemma":"약속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있다고","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하지","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않았어?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71581","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"a39ee87db456831e","term":"약속","zh":"约定，约好，承诺","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3","entryId":"36695","definition":"事先决定与他人一起做某事；或指那样定下的内容。","pronunciation":["약쏙"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"将要完成或进行某件事情。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71581","definition":"用于否定前文所指的行为。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/34c4ca447d7963e390fa.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66864-1-7-2","ko":"앗! 깜빡 잊고 있었다.","zh":"啊！我完全给忘了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"앗!","meaning":"唷","explanation":"앗：唷","readings":[{"term":"앗","audio":"/audio/a28f6e8256f2559b68d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66864","senseId":"1","lemma":"앗","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"깜빡","meaning":"迷糊","explanation":"깜빡：迷糊","readings":[{"term":"깜빡","audio":"/audio/4321affb2e1354f792f9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32556","senseId":"3","lemma":"깜빡","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잊고","meaning":"忘，忘记","explanation":"잊다：忘，忘记；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"잊다","audio":"/audio/b0566314f635fe32e273.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70067","senseId":"2","lemma":"잊다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있었다.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a28f6e8256f2559b","term":"앗","zh":"唷","audio":"/audio/a28f6e8256f2559b68d6.mp3","entryId":"66864","definition":"吃惊时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["앋"]},{"id":"4321affb2e1354f7","term":"깜빡","zh":"